# CopilotKit lessons — just one key needed!
#
# Unlike learn-langgraph / learn-mcp which need 6 TR Orchestrator vars,
# CopilotKit lessons use standard OpenAI directly.
#
# Quick start:
#   1. Copy this file to .env
#   2. Add your OpenAI API key
#   3. Run any lesson:  uv run python 01_hello_copilotkit.py
#   4. (Optional) Start the frontend:  cd frontend && npm install && npm run dev

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
